The waters of life flow through you, purifying any poisons or diseases currently affecting you.

For [5, 7, 9, 11, 12 (TL1-5)] turns, all poisons and diseases will heal you instead of damaging you.

When activated, it also heals you for [22, 29, 34, 38, 42 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] life for each disease or poison you have.

The healing per disease/poison will increase with your Willpower.
